# What the sdist carries, beyond what setuptools_scm's file finder offers
# it. The finder offers every git-tracked file, which is the right default
# for a repository of source and documentation and the wrong one as soon as
# something tracked is large and regenerable.
#
# docs/plans/audit/diffs/ is exactly that. The push audit in
# docs/plans/PLAN-library-api-and-collection-phase-06-push-audit.md records
# the ten per-merge diffs it read, 1.2MB of them, so that a reader can check
# its findings against the code as it was. They stay in git for that reason.
# They are also mechanically reproducible from the loop in
# docs/plans/audit/README.md, and they describe this project's history
# rather than being part of it, so shipping them to everyone who installs
# from source forever is all cost. The findings and the triage, which are
# judgements and cannot be regenerated, are small and stay.
prune docs/plans/audit/diffs
